# SQ - Squeeze one file

```text
SQ [drive:]file [destination-drive:]
```

## Squeeze a file

```text
B0:SQ A:NOTES.TXT D:
```

SQ reads the source twice and writes NOTES.TQT on D. Keep the source
unchanged until both passes finish. Select one exact filename in the
current user area. Without a destination drive, output goes to the
logged drive.

## Squeeze a topic

For PIP.HLP the compressed name is PIP.HQP. HELP can read it loose or as
an LBR member. Use [USQ](USQ.HLP) to restore an editable copy or
[NOAH](NOAH.HLP#help-libraries) to build a library.
